WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We've been squatting here for three days and we're very familiar with it.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Why don't we go in together and stand down and divide the supplies in half?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:17,520
No, you go ahead

4
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,060
I'll go after you go

5
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,060
Then you hold my cigarette instead

6
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,060
Friends, there is danger everywhere now.

7
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:27,060
One more person means one more caregiver.

8
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,060
Then our spirit is with you

9
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,060
May God bless you too

10
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,060
You take us in together

11
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,060
We only need 30% of the supplies

12
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,060
Then we are here

13
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,060
we are right here

14
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:44,190
we are right here
